{"id":"n711c3a4f0d","headline":"Iran war erases global growth upgrade, fans inflation: OECD","summary":"The OECD projects global GDP growth at 2.9% in 2026, edging up to 3% in 2027. The Iran war has erased an earlier growth upgrade and is fanning inflation.","why":"The OECD is the Paris-based group of advanced economies that publishes widely watched global growth forecasts. Its outlook shapes expectations for central-bank policy and corporate earnings.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Paris","country":"France","lat":48.86,"lon":2.35,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Business Times","url":"https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/international/global/iran-war-erases-global-growth-upgrade-fans-inflation-oecd"},"sources":[{"name":"The Business Times","url":"https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/international/global/iran-war-erases-global-growth-upgrade-fans-inflation-oecd"}],"published_at":"2026-03-26T10:31:22Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"91b6031cb6722e09","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-03-26T10:31:22Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-03-26T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"CH","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/city-skyline-business-district-1568042.jpg","alt":"city skyline business district (illustration)","credit":"xusenru","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/moscow-city-russia-metropolis-1568042/"}}